{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Art of Reflection is a first-person puzzle game that explores mirrors as if you could pass right through them. What happens when you cross through a mirror and walk around in mirror-land? What if objects, or even gravity aren't the same on the other side? Unfold complex reflected paths as you learn to navigate this world with mastery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290770/extras/a256928eae448a1425f2bf68b48ad046.poster.avif?t=1764608311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290770/extras/a256928eae448a1425f2bf68b48ad046.webm?t=1764608311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290770/extras/a256928eae448a1425f2bf68b48ad046.mp4?t=1764608311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary tool is a snap zoom that lets you pass through mirrors, cover long distances in an instant, redirect effortlessly midair in slow-motion, and more. Solve puzzles inside a room, then clamber your way upside-down across the back side of the same structure. A labyrinthine architecture is waiting for you to uncover its hidden corners. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290770/extras/0a496de3fdfe54530f3838184f2622d9.poster.avif?t=1764608311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290770/extras/0a496de3fdfe54530f3838184f2622d9.webm?t=1764608311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290770/extras/0a496de3fdfe54530f3838184f2622d9.mp4?t=1764608311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Restored Symphony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2290770/b9a81c5ba6dda0a05d532277f0dc372a2a262ca5.jpg"},{"name":"Finished Symphony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2290770/95544e5f3c0523862f5ab04730360cd50dce43e4.jpg"},{"name":"Infinite Reflections","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2290770/9dabb4b0942de8c46c5266fecfdbd35e338ffc1d.jpg"},{"name":"Aeronaut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2290770/693bd12d5853b06277af2c5ac4e3abdfcc21a3f9.jpg"},{"name":"Subliminal Message Inspection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2290770/d46aade62993cd5175939d29d06c299d059a72e9.jpg"},{"name":"See the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2290770/1b739192713723b8351a1149891fa61b7935a40b.jpg"},{"name":"Long Haul Flier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2290770/64738c95440d9120f94d1bde199cd293a68142b5.jpg"},{"name":"Edge of the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2290770/e816576d2a19c2dbcdbed539f8af29b75d5af1dd.jpg"},{"name":"Bet the Dev Didn't Think of This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2290770/23056ced5ab3ffe8bd3d8f8d9c361ac67d0aa58b.jpg"},{"name":"Gallery of Reflections","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2290770/00d5a1662d75683d5af69a22ca1336eed37febf0.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2290770?t=1764608311","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764608311","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.s